{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06363","headline":"春送从叔游襄阳 · 李颀","name":"春送从叔游襄阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"言别恨非一，弃置我宗英。\n向用五经笥，今爲千里行。\n裹粮顾庭草，羸马诘朝鸣。\n斗酒对寒食，杂花宜晚晴。\n春衣采洲路，夜饮南阳城。\n客梦岘山晓，渔歌江水清。\n楚俗少相知，远游难称情。\n同人应馆谷，刺史在郊迎。\n只合侍丹扆，翻令辞上京。\n时方春欲暮，叹息向流莺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}